{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126190826966-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126200242\"/><p>今日(26日)下午2時14分，尖沙咀柯士甸道西1號一間銀行的職員報案，指懷疑有人以5張面值100美元的懷疑偽鈔存款。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕姓黃(66歲)男子，他現正被扣留調查。據悉，被捕人士為台灣人，暫時未知偽鈔來源。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:43:54.942154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:08:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:16.741241+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:16.741241+00:00","content_hash":"7548bfb2a48b3b60ef782a3a0c0e9b94371bfbaf7396bc47b7701772e6069702","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}